---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { processSchema } from '../data/schemas';
---

<Layout title="Our Process – How The Tormont 50 Delivers Value" description="Discover The Tormont 50 process for connecting companies with institutional investors—data-driven reports, analytics, CEO conversations, and podcast placement." bodyClass="" schema={processSchema}>
<div class="section top-section pd-bottom-140px"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="max-w-490px tablet-max-w-100 reveal-on-scroll"><h1 class="display-1 mg-bottom-0">Process</h1></div></div></div>
<div><div class="container-default w-container"><section class="_w-full"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-27 w-container"><div class="timeline-wrapper"><div class="section-title-wrapper-3 timeline reveal-on-scroll"></div></div><div><section class="work-process-section padding"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-30 w-container"><div class="section-content-wrapper-2"><div class="process-content-wrapper-2 style-02"><div class="process-wrapper style-02 reveal-on-scroll"><div class="single-process"><div class="process-number-box style-02"><div class="process-number-wrapper style-02"><h2 class="process-number-2 style-02">1</h2></div></div><div class="process-title-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-h2-size">Discovery</h3><p class="text-base">We begin with deep listening and fact-finding. Through conversations with boards, CEOs, and key stakeholders, we uncover underlying challenges, organizational dynamics, and growth opportunities that are often overlooked.</p></div></div><div class="single-process"><div class="process-number-box style-02"><div class="process-number-wrapper style-02"><h4 class="process-number-2 style-02">2</h4></div></div><div class="process-title-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-h2-size">Audit</h3><p class="text-base">This provides a clear, evidence-based picture of where disconnects exist and where improvements will have the most impact.</p></div></div><div class="single-process"><div class="process-number-box style-02"><div class="process-number-wrapper style-02"><h4 class="process-number-2 style-02">3</h4></div></div><div class="process-title-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-h2-size">Rapid Resolution</h3><p class="text-base"> Our interventions focus on pragmatic solutions that deliver immediate clarity and restore momentum at the top levels of leadership.</p></div></div><div class="single-process"><div class="process-number-box style-02"><div class="process-number-wrapper style-02"><h4 class="process-number-2 style-02">4</h4></div></div><div class="process-title-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-h2-size">Design</h3><p class="text-base">Once alignment is established, we co-create strategies, structures, and processes that build resilience and unlock long-term value. </p></div></div><div class="single-process"><div class="process-number-box style-02"><div class="process-number-wrapper style-02"><h4 class="process-number-2 style-02">5</h4></div></div><div class="process-title-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-h2-size">Feedback Loop</h3><p class="text-base">Finally, we embed continuous feedback mechanisms to monitor progress and adapt as circumstances evolve. </p></div></div><img decoding="async" alt="Process Line" class="process-line-02" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b59db54d8b1bafec21017c/67b59db54d8b1bafec21029a_Line%2076%20(1).svg"/></div><div class="process-image-wrapper-2 reveal-on-scroll"><img decoding="async" alt="About Image" class="about-image process-image" loading="lazy" src="/images/68ce8d9a93c81840d87dc031_unnamed-1.webp" width="1005"/></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></section></div></div>
<div class="section"><div class="container-default w-container"></div></div>
</Layout>
